COMPLEXITY ANALYSIS

1. Tree Construction
Time Complexity: O(n)

2. Level-Order Traversal
Time Complexity: O(n)
Space Complexity: O(n)

3. Linear Search
Best Case: O(1)
Average Case: O(n)
Worst Case: O(n)
Space: O(1)

4. Binary Search
Best Case: O(1)
Average Case: O(log n)
Worst Case: O(log n)
Space: O(1)

5. Tree Height
Height = 3 edges
Number of levels = 4
